// The same query as ../as_at_release_by_department.dax on the hidden plain (naive) form of the measure, so that before and after run the same query.
// Slow measure 1, plain form, shaped like a table: Outturn as at Release by release and department of the current
// structure for all 31 releases (every year each release had reached added together).
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Release'[Release Label],
    'Department (current structure)'[Department Number],
    "as_at", [Outturn as at Release (naive)]
)
ORDER BY 'Release'[Release Label], 'Department (current structure)'[Department Number]
